---
---

<section id="crm-overview" class="crm-overview-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">GESTÃO DE ATENDIMENTO & CRM</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Além da Inteligência Artificial no atendimento, <br />
        <span class="highlight">o que mais você pode fazer no seu CRM?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Você tem o controle total da operação. Além das automações automáticas, sua empresa ganha uma central unificada para gerenciar toda a equipe, múltiplos números e canais em um só lugar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Unified CRM Capabilities Grid (4 Rectangles with Standard Site SVG Icons) -->
    <div class="crm-rectangles-grid">
      
      <!-- Rectangle 1: Múltiplos WhatsApps -->
      <div class="crm-rect-card" style="--card-index: 0">
        <div class="rect-header">
          <div class="rect-icon green-bg">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347z"/>
              <path d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 1.891.524 3.66 1.434 5.176L2 22l4.956-1.378A9.956 9.956 0 0 0 12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2zm0 18c-1.642 0-3.171-.448-4.484-1.229l-.322-.19-2.956.822.836-2.885-.208-.33A7.954 7.954 0 0 1 4 12c0-4.411 3.589-8 8-8s8 3.589 8 8-3.589 8-8 8z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="rect-tag">CENTRALIZAÇÃO</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Múltiplos WhatsApps & Colaboradores</h3>
        <p>Conecte o WhatsApp principal da empresa e os números individuais dos seus vendedores e colaboradores. O gestor acompanha todo o histórico sem depender do celular pessoal da equipe.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Rectangle 2: Vários Canais -->
      <div class="crm-rect-card" style="--card-index: 1">
        <div class="rect-header">
          <div class="rect-icon multi-channel-icons">
            <svg class="svg-brand ig-color" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
            </svg>
            <svg class="svg-brand tt-color" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 0 1-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 1 1-5.2-1.74 2.89 2.89 0 0 1 2.31-2.83V7.63a6.34 6.34 0 0 0-5.11 6.22A6.34 6.34 0 1 0 15.82 20V11a8.16 8.16 0 0 0 4.77 1.52v-3.4a4.85 4.85 0 0 1-1-.43z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="rect-tag">MULTICANAL</span>
        </div>
        <h3>WhatsApp, Instagram, TikTok & Site</h3>
        <p>Receba todas as conversas do Instagram Direct, TikTok, chat do site e WhatsApp na mesma caixa de entrada. Sua equipe atende qualquer canal em uma única tela.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Rectangle 3: Regras por Canal -->
      <div class="crm-rect-card" style="--card-index: 2">
        <div class="rect-header">
          <div class="rect-icon purple-bg">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
              <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="rect-tag">CONTROLE DE REGRAS</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Regras Manuais ou com IA por Número</h3>
        <p>Escolha como cada número funciona: ative a IA em um WhatsApp de pré-vendas, coloque um chatbot tradicional no suporte e mantenha outro número 100% manual para atendimento humano.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Rectangle 4: Atendimento Manual & Supervisão -->
      <div class="crm-rect-card" style="--card-index: 3">
        <div class="rect-header">
          <div class="rect-icon amber-bg">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="rect-tag">SUPERVISÃO</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Atendimento Manual & Gestão de Equipe</h3>
        <p>Sua equipe pode atender manualmente no dia a dia, transferir conversas entre setores, usar respostas rápidas, escutar áudios e acompanhar métricas em tempo real.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .crm-overview-section {
    padding: 90px 0;
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: #0f172a;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  .shell {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.12);
    color: #008f70;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.7rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .section-title .highlight {
    color: #008f70;
  }

  .section-desc {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #475569;
  }

  /* 4 Rectangles Grid */
  .crm-rectangles-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 30px;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .crm-rect-card {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(86px + (var(--card-index) * 18px));
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .crm-rect-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: #00a884;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .rect-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .rect-icon {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .svg-icon {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .multi-channel-icons {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    padding: 0 8px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .svg-brand {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .ig-color { color: #e1306c; }
  .tt-color { color: #000000; }

  .green-bg { background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.15); color: #008f70; }
  .blue-bg { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); color: #2563eb; }
  .purple-bg { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); color: #9333ea; }
  .amber-bg { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: #d97706; }

  .rect-tag {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #64748b;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .crm-rect-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .crm-rect-card p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .crm-rectangles-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
